---
import { appLinks } from '../../data/links';
---
<section class="e-sec" id="pricing" style="padding-top: 0">
  <div class="e-wrap">
    <div class="e-head-c">
      <span class="e-kicker">Pricing</span>
      <h2 class="e-h2">Start free. Sprint before the drive.</h2>
      <p class="e-lead">Pay by UPI. No subscriptions, nothing renews.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="e-prices">
      <div class="e-card e-hover e-price">
        <span class="nm">First mock</span>
        <div class="amt">₹0</div>
        <p>See where you stand today, with no signup to start.</p>
        <ul>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>1 full 10-minute mock</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Scored report with quotes</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>1 retry of your weakest answer</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Shareable score card</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={appLinks.signup} class="e-btn-ghost">Start free mock</a>
      </div>
      <div class="e-card e-price e-pro">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center"><span class="nm">Placement Sprint</span><span class="e-pill">Best before a drive</span></div>
        <div class="amt">₹249<small>/ 30 days</small></div>
        <p>Everything you need to go from first mock to drive-ready.</p>
        <ul>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>10 full mocks, all levels</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Unlimited single-question retries</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Progress graph across every mock</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Countdown plan to your drive date</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="e-guar"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.4 8-8 9-4.6-1-8-4.5-8-9V6z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span><b>+15 guarantee.</b> Finish all 10 mocks in 30 days. If your readiness hasn’t risen 15 points, you get your money back.</span></div>
        <a href={appLinks.signup} class="e-btn-primary">Get the Sprint</a>
      </div>
      <div class="e-card e-hover e-price">
        <span class="nm">Placement cells</span>
        <div class="amt" style="font-size: 44px">Pilot</div>
        <p>For TPOs who want batch-level readiness before the season.</p>
        <ul>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Mock-day QR and join link</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Readiness by branch</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Weakest areas and common deductions</li>
          <li class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>CSV export</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="e-btn-ghost">Talk to us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
